242 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 170 0 R/E(The dough company that was Artisadough became focused on a product rather than the dough and was born into Donutste Doughnuts. We quickly scaled from Florida farmers markets \(Lake Mary Farmers Market, Mount Dora Farmers Market, Vegan Market, and Winter Park pop-ups\) into a cottage shop in Lake Mary. Due to very high demand, we came up with a plan with the city of Lake Mary directly, which required us to move to a pre-order-only model. We are now opening up a fully retail-based shop in Winter Park right by the new-to-come Fairbanks exchange. )/Pg 14 0 R/K[24]>>
endobj

