351 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 182 0 R/T(Brief Overview: Donutste was created to craft the best donuts and cinnamon rolls in the world\204plant-based, chef-driven, and made for donut lovers everywhere, whether they\220re vegan or not. Because our dough contains no eggs, milk, or dairy, we\220re intentional about offering treats that taste incredible while supporting a more sustainable way of eating. Alongside our pastries, we serve carefully curated coffee that\220s ethically sourced and expertly brewed, creating a caf\351 experience that\220s indulgent, inclusive, and rooted in care.)/E(Brief Overview: Donutste was created to craft the best donuts and cinnamon rolls in the world\204plant-based, chef-driven, and made for donut lovers everywhere, whether they\220re vegan or not. Because our dough contains no eggs, milk, or dairy, we\220re intentional about offering treats that taste incredible while supporting a more sustainable way of eating. Alongside our pastries, we serve carefully curated coffee that\220s ethically sourced and expertly brewed, creating a caf\351 experience that\220s indulgent, inclusive, and rooted in care.)/Pg 26 0 R/K[3]>>
endobj

